WEBVTT

00:00:01.527 --> 00:00:03.507
<v><b>Maria:</b></v> A cappuccino, please.

00:00:03.897 --> 00:00:05.190
<v><b>Andrew:</b></v> A tea for me.

00:00:05.479 --> 00:00:07.826
<v><b>Sally:</b></v> And a tea for me, too.

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:09.616
<v><b>Assistant:</b></v> What’s your name?

00:00:09.955 --> 00:00:10.833
<v><b>Maria:</b></v> Maria.

00:00:11.055 --> 00:00:12.484
<v><b>Andrew:</b></v> I’m Andrew.

00:00:12.922 --> 00:00:14.090
<v><b>Sally:</b></v> I’m Sally.

00:00:14.876 --> 00:00:17.830
<v><b>Assistant:</b></v> Two teas and one cappuccino.